OL,3,GNEWSAHow much art does your council own
OL,4,Aand is it locked away or on display?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFewer than one in 20 artworks owned by
OL,7,FEnglish councils are on public display,
OL,8,Fthe BBC has found.
OL,10,FMore than 500,000 pieces of art are
OL,11,Fheld in the collections of 225
OL,12,Fcouncils, but the vast majority is
OL,13,Fbeing kept in storage.
OL,15,FLocal authorities remain "the biggest
OL,16,Fsingle constituent of public funding
OL,17,Ffor arts and culture", according to the
OL,18,Fchief executive of the charity Art UK.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
